# Ballad / soul-gospel: 25 churchy soul-pop hooks (8 verses, 6 pre-choruses, 7 choruses, 4 bridges).
# Plagal F-C and F-Fm-C moves, passing dominant sevenths (C7, E7, A7), held notes made for melisma.
# Key of C major / A minor, sung pitch (C4 = middle C). Verses G3-G4, other sections G3-E5.

